'''Gold Gift Talisman''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Accessories|Accessory]] that grants the [[player]] {{Green|+25%}} {{C|alt=Coin}} and [[Skills|EXP]] rewards from [[Gift|gifts]]. It is the upgraded form of the {{Item|Purple Gift Talisman}} and is the final accessory in the "Gift Talisman" line.

== Obtaining ==
=== Purchase ===
The '''Gold Gift Talisman''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Einary}} at {{Zone|Einary's Emporium}} in {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.

Note: This item is purchasable only during '''December of real life'''. When attempting to buy it outside the period, the player will get a "Only sold in December!" error message. This applies to all lower tier purchases too.
